{"4451370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grand Cru: The Wine Maker", "steam_appid": 4451370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From Grape to Glass, Every Choice Matters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Grand Cru, every decision you make — from the vineyard to the wine glass — shapes your wine's final score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451370/extras/f5d082d1ac7da218dcaccaf4e64a6bab.avif?t=1786197785\" width=1560 height=1598 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌍 Terroir</strong> — Soil type, climate, and vine age determine your grape's potential before you touch a single cluster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451370/extras/4440449c350c04c56a4d4a08ebd94ba9.avif?t=1786197785\" width=1560 height=1738 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🪵 Oak Barrels</strong> — French, Hungarian, or American oak — each variety, freshness level, and grape tolerance shifts the flavor profile. Pick wrong and you'll flatten the fruit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451370/extras/385e4a5bcfbd8503291e4a30c3394184.avif?t=1786197785\" width=1560 height=1950 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⭐ Four Pillars of Quality</strong> — Your wine is scored on Structure, Authenticity, Finish, and Complexity — just like real wine critics evaluate Bordeaux.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451370/extras/893e1e10bde5ec9131bc3a73d0fee828.avif?t=1786197785\" width=1560 height=1940 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📊 Critics vs. Public</strong> — Critics reward complexity and structure. The public wants fruit and approachability. The same wine can score 90 with one and 65 with the other. Know your market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Create your own wine style. Your vineyard, your rules.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >From Grape to Glass, Every Choice Matters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Grand Cru, every decision you make — from the vineyard to the wine glass — shapes your wine's final score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451370/extras/f5d082d1ac7da218dcaccaf4e64a6bab.avif?t=1786197785\" width=1560 height=1598 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🌍 Terroir</strong> — Soil type, climate, and vine age determine your grape's potential before you touch a single cluster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451370/extras/4440449c350c04c56a4d4a08ebd94ba9.avif?t=1786197785\" width=1560 height=1738 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🪵 Oak Barrels</strong> — French, Hungarian, or American oak — each variety, freshness level, and grape tolerance shifts the flavor profile. Pick wrong and you'll flatten the fruit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451370/extras/385e4a5bcfbd8503291e4a30c3394184.avif?t=1786197785\" width=1560 height=1950 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⭐ Four Pillars of Quality</strong> — Your wine is scored on Structure, Authenticity, Finish, and Complexity — just like real wine critics evaluate Bordeaux.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451370/extras/893e1e10bde5ec9131bc3a73d0fee828.avif?t=1786197785\" width=1560 height=1940 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>📊 Critics vs. Public</strong> — Critics reward complexity and structure. The public wants fruit and approachability. The same wine can score 90 with one and 65 with the other. Know your market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Create your own wine style. Your vineyard, your rules.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Master the art of Bordeaux. Navigate volatile weather RNG and out-negotiate 25 unique buyers with your own pricing strategy. From terroir scoring to Michelin-star contracts, every vintage is a high-stakes calculation. A deep, data-driven simulation for those who take wine—and management—seriously.", "supported_languages": "English, Korean, German, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451370/c97a3d186df3a91ff9320eba5f1c6f32eb8dd4f7/header.jpg?t=1786197785", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451370/d41443b46fb982d3bd36a2d8246d6930b3e8ed88/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786197785", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451370/d41443b46fb982d3bd36a2d8246d6930b3e8ed88/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786197785", "website": "https://grandcruthewinemaker.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><